# Design & testing skill routing

Read this rule when the task touches **UI** (features in `apps/web`, `packages/ui`) or **verification** (API routes, browser checks, claiming work done).

Full registry and dual-use verdicts: [`docs/13-agent-tooling.md`](../docs/13-agent-tooling.md) § 2.3.

## Product UI constraints (AI Studio)

Before any design skill: [`docs/09-ui-spec.md`](../docs/09-ui-spec.md) § 9 — light theme, Inter, blue accent, minimalist **Operate** surfaces. Use `@aiflow/ui` primitives and semantic tokens (`text-fg-muted`, `border-border`, `bg-surface`). Do **not** use Anthropic `frontend-design` (rejected in § 2.1). Prefer **`impeccable`** Operate mode over **`design-taste-frontend`** (marketing-only).

## Decision tree

```
Task type?
├─ New/changed product screen or component (dashboard, chat, editor, settings)
│   ├─ Before merge → impeccable `audit` (shortcut: audit/) on the route or slice
│   ├─ Visual pass → impeccable `polish` (shortcut: polish/)
│   └─ UX critique only → impeccable `critique` (shortcut: critique/)
├─ Landing / marketing page (not in MVP scope)
│   └─ design-taste-frontend OR imagegen-frontend-web → image-to-code (defer unless asked)
├─ Need real-world UI references before designing
│   └─ ui-radar (UIZZE API or connector; optional)
├─ Accessibility / guidelines check on existing markup
│   └─ web-design-guidelines
├─ API or route handlers changed
│   └─ api-smoke-testing (compose up; auth cookies as needed)
├─ Frontend behaviour check (light, no server needed)
│   └─ webapp-testing (Python Playwright scripts) OR agent-browser for one-off
├─ Full E2E against running server
│   └─ `yarn test:e2e` → Playwright (`apps/web/e2e/`); needs `docker compose up` or `yarn dev`
├─ About to claim done / commit / open PR
│   ├─ verification-before-completion → run `yarn verify` (or `docker compose exec app yarn verify`)
│   └─ Cloud Agent + UI change → walkthrough-artifacts (screenshot / RecordScreen)
└─ Adding persistent E2E suite
    └─ e2e-testing-patterns + playwright-best-practices (configured: `apps/web/e2e/`, `yarn test:e2e`; needs running server)
```

## Workflow hooks

| When | Skill | Notes |
| ---- | ----- | ----- |
| UI feature branch, pre-PR | `audit` → fix → optional `polish` | Target `apps/web/src/features/<slice>/` or route |
| REST/API feature | `api-smoke-testing` | After `docker compose up`; seed dev user if auth required |
| Bugfix / feature claim | `verification-before-completion` | Evidence before "done" |
| Cloud Agent UI delivery | `walkthrough-artifacts` | Minimal screenshot or short recording |
| New unit behaviour | `test-driven-development` | Vitest only today — no E2E gate in CI |

## Overlap

- **`/verify`** command = mechanical gate; **`verification-before-completion`** = discipline (no success claims without fresh output).
- **`reviewer`** subagent = code/spec review; **`impeccable audit`** = UX/visual quality on UI surfaces.
- **`qa-expert`** = heavy process docs; skip unless building a QA handoff pack.
